sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alpaca Historical API
    participant T as Trace Builder
    participant D as Replay Driver
    participant S as SMA Strategy
    participant L as Raft Leader
    participant F as Two Followers
    participant E as Execution State on Each Node

    A->>T: Historical SPY 1-minute OHLCV bars
    T->>T: Validate, sort, normalize prices to integers
    T-->>D: Fixed trace + metadata + checksum

    D->>L: Initialize simulated account
    L->>F: Persist and replicate command
    F-->>L: Durable acknowledgments
    Note over L,F: Commit after durable majority
    L->>E: Apply initialization in log order

    loop Each completed bar k
        D->>L: MarketBar(k), stable request ID
        L->>F: AppendEntries containing bar k
        F-->>L: Acknowledge after durable storage
        Note over L,F: Leader advances commit index
        L->>F: Announce commit index
        L->>E: Apply committed bar k
        Note over E: Fill previously pending orders at open(k)<br/>Update cash, positions, orders, and fills
        L-->>D: Applied result and simulated fills

        D->>S: Reveal completed bar k and updated portfolio
        S->>S: Update 5-bar and 20-bar SMAs

        opt SMA crossover generates an order
            S-->>D: Buy or sell 10 shares
            D->>L: SubmitOrder, stable request ID
            L->>F: Persist and replicate order
            F-->>L: Durable acknowledgments
            L->>F: Announce commitment
            L->>E: Apply order as pending
            L-->>D: Order accepted awaiting next bar
        end
    end

    Note over D,E: An order generated after close(k)<br/>can execute at open(k+1), never open(k)

    D->>E: Inspect replicas at common applied index
    E-->>D: Orders, fills, portfolio, and state digests
    D->>D: Compare replicas and save experiment results